Subject: Graduate College ETD Account Registration
To complete registration of your ETD account, please click the link
below:

  {REGISTRATION_URL}

The login URL you will need to visit to log in will be (Please keep this email, as this link is only for those without NetID and not advertised):
https://etd.ideals.illinois.edu/login

If you need assistance with your account, please email
thesis@illinois.edu or call us at 217-333-0035.

The Thesis Office
